packageManager in the script's package.json: Pnpm (packageManager in packages/app/package.json) version=10.4.1
packageManager at the workspace root: Pnpm (packageManager in package.json) version=10.4.1
nearest packageManager wins: Bun (packageManager in packages/app/package.json) version=1.3.0
devEngines object: Npm (devEngines in package.json) version=^11.0.0
devEngines array, first supported entry: Pnpm (devEngines in package.json) version=>=10
devEngines array, several supported: Pnpm (devEngines in package.json)
